<title>USA: Imation Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Imation Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OAKDALE, Minn. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		     $   0.30		   $ 0.14</p>
<p> Net			 12,000		    6,100</p>
<p> Revs		     547,700		  576,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  40,697		   41,930</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 net reduced by $0.17 a share from foreign currency translations.</p>
<p>About half the revenue decline reflects company's decision to exit certain underperforming businesses. Revenues reduced by about 3.5 percent by strengthening of dollar.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 net includes pre-tax restructuring charge of $10.4 million, or $0.15 a share after-tax.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
